 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) the eldest son follows Wang Lung",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I have heard that my father's daughter-in-law is a woman of good birth and her brothers are among the rich men of the town.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) wears silk clothing",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung calls out to his second son.",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Now tell me what is in your head, my son, for you are never idle.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son explains his plans to his father.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"I am building a grain market, but I must have a good house, which I do not have, for I have no silver to buy one.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung gives his eldest son money.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Take this, then, and buy a good door for the main gate.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) gives silver to eldest son",
  "[action] The eldest son gives silver to his younger brother.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son gives his father a gift.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"There is a good house in the town, but it is small and the people say it is a fine house.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"How much did you buy it for?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"For twenty taels.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"The men say it is a fine house, and the women say it is a good house, and I have heard it said the women say it is a good house for a young wife.\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and a good house it is for anyone, then, even for a fool and a woman.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"The wife is good and the daughters are fair, and it is a good house for a young wife.\"",
  "[action] (to the second son) The eldest son walks with his father and brother, looking at the new house.",
  "[action] Wang Lung and his sons return home."
 ],
